 <name>手帳 Techo</name>
 <launchable type="desktop-id">org.bushidos.Techo.desktop</launchable>
 <_summary>A Text Editor</_summary>
 <_description>
  <p>
   Techo is a small, but powerful text editor. It has most standard text editor functions and fully
   supports international text in Unicode. Advanced features include syntax
   highlighting and automatic indentation of source code, printing and editing
   of multiple documents in one window.
  </p>
  <p>
   Techo is extensible through a plugin system, which currently includes
   support for spell checking, comparing files, viewing CVS ChangeLogs, and
   adjusting indentation levels.
  </p>
  <p>
   Techo is a fork of Xed by Linux Mint.
  </p>
 </_description>
 <url type="homepage">http://www.github.com/linuxmint/xed</url>
</component>
